# Dev workstation packages for winget
# Format: ACTION|WINGET_ID|DISPLAY_NAME[|PROBE]
# ACTION:
#   upgrade — winget upgrade (package expected via winget)
#   install — winget install (idempotent if already present)
#   ensure  — if PROBE command exists on PATH, skip (externally managed);
#             otherwise winget install as fallback
#
upgrade|OpenJS.NodeJS.LTS|Node.js LTS
ensure|Python.Python.3.14|Python 3.14|py
upgrade|Microsoft.PowerShell|PowerShell 7
install|GoLang.Go|Go
upgrade|Microsoft.VisualStudioCode|Visual Studio Code
ensure|PHP.PHP.NTS.8.5|PHP 8.5 NTS|php
upgrade|Git.Git|Git
upgrade|GitHub.cli|GitHub CLI
